    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d280">

                <pb facs="0246" n="172" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg172"/>

                <head>Mr. Hunter to Sir F. Bruce</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-06-07"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 7,1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your communication of the 5th instant, relative to the charges levied on
                    British vessels in the port of Boston, and to inform you that the necessity for
                    a consideration of its contents has been anticipated by my note of to-day and
                    its accompaniments, upon the subject, wherein it is stated by the Secretary of
                    the Treasury that no fee for readmeasurement of British vessels will be charged;
                    but that the tax cannot, in compliance with the act of the 6th of May, 1864, be
                    levied upon the basis afforded by the British register. The collector of the
                    port of Boston has been authorized to refund any excess of tonnage he may have
                    received under the act of the 6th of May, 1864.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with the highest consideration, sir, your obedient
                    servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>W. HUNTER, <hi rendition="#italic">Acting
                    Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir Frederick W. A. Bruce,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
